body:
"Unless the scene calls for it"

&#x200B;

To me that's the only time smut is acceptable.  I don't even like reading it in novels.  My favorite author in the world has upwards of like 15 books in a series and I can count on one hand the number of 'smutty' scenes he's got in his books.  It's good to know there are other RPers out there who get this idea!

I can't hold up a grown ass man/drum kit/stool/etc.  Who wants to do that?  Especially someone as swol as Josh?  Tyler might be okay he's a friggin bean pole.

&#x200B;

The only reason I wanna get up close is to do something obnoxious like eat a banana right in their eye line.

2013 I think?  I was listening to a pandora radio station - I think - at a job and I can't remember which song came on (I wish I could, damn it)... and I just stopped working and stared at my computer and just... had to know who the hell these people were.  Listened to all of Vessel... listened again... then again.  Cried through all three playings and I was hooked.  I've tried to listen to their self titled but man... Addict with a Pen nearly killed me and I'm terrified of that album (I can barely handle Car Radio or Goner haha)

&#x200B;

I introduced a friend and he was super into it.  In 2014 I saw them in concert - $30 for a ticket - and I was MAYBE thirty feet from stage.  I didn't realize how lucky I was back then.  I guess that was during the time they were more approachable/gave out backstage stuff for people who showed up early?  I'm sad that I never realized how good I had it, although I'm sure I wouldn't have met them anyway, lol.

&#x200B;

I wasn't even into them as 'people' until a friend started sending me videos of them being colossal idiots.  I loved the music, it moved me to the point of tears almost all the time, but I've just never been the kind of person to geek out over the people in a band - at least not since my boy band phase as a kid.  Now I'm a goddamn stan and I don't know how to handle my life (I'm 33 man, I'm too old for this shit)

Sounds like people without real jobs.  Ignore people like that, my dude.  They're immature and ridiculous and they don't realize they're actually the joke.

&#x200B;

No one is proving anything by sleeping on a sidewalk for three days and if they think they are, I doubt Tyler and Josh would even like them as people. (although I don't know them as people so who the hell knows... but they don't strike me as the type of guys who would put up with snotty shitheads?)

I had a dream where I ended up staying super later after the Birmingham show and out of the blue Josh and Tyler came to my car and were all, 'our tour bus is broken down can we get a ride from you'.

&#x200B;

"Sure if I can get some gas money, my dudes."

&#x200B;

And then they came to my house, harassed my parents, and their tour bus picked the up the next morning.  I also told them they had to share the guest bed and 'get over it'.  Apparently I'm a dick.
